From 61a8bc5946a6ae4c35ad8549d19f546ea1e5a464 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 16:04:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Route RSA-OAEP MGF1 to software keymint

Some detectors (e.g. Duck Detector) will treat alogrithm that is not accepted by device's QTI Keymint as a sign of TEE
spoof

So we route it to SOFTWARE Keymint to bypass such detection

Change-Id: I359d105a75a808833b892d125c687b724df55692
